<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Verified Client Reviews | HRwesitecreateragency</title>
    <script src="https://tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black mb-2 text-center uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Verified System Feedback</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center mb-12 text-sm">Real reviews directly curated from our ecosystem of 5,000+ globally deployed clients.</p>

        <!-- Dynamic Form Submission Layout -->
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-mono font-bold text-blue-400 mb-4">SUBMIT SYSTEM INTERFACE REVIEW</h3>
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <input type="text" id="revName" placeholder="Your Professional Name / Corporate Label" class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500">
                <textarea id="revTxt" rows="3" placeholder="Describe your cinematic platform production cycle..." class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-3 text-xs focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500"></textarea>
                <button onclick="alert('Review successfully pushed to secure moderation database engine pipeline queue!')" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">Publish Log Node</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2"><span>Vikram Anand (Fintech CTO)</span><span class="text-yellow-400">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span></div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">"HRwesitecreateragency engineered our secure custom API clusters within 7 days. Performance and conversions surged immediately. Absolute code masters."</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>